{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/ed253545e260ae3b6b29a54746b1e327.avif?t=1772541551\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a major crossover between Indian cinema and interactive entertainment, Mystic Pillars x Kantara update marks a significant expansion to the game.\u00a0The new free update introduces a narrative collaboration inspired by the cinematic universe of Indian movie Kantara by Hombale Films - blending folklore, spirituality,\u00a0and logic-based gameplay into a culturally rooted gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The expansion includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Newly designed thematic puzzles for the Kantara village</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated cinematic cutscenes capturing the mystic forest tone with Kannada Voice Overs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental restoration of Kantara village where solving puzzles visually heals the land</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/1aefbc957ca7cd8a4f26198ab671d42a.avif?t=1772541551\" width=600 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a mysterious traveller whose journey across the world lands you in the kingdom of Zampi. Resolve the drought plaguing the once-prosperous kingdom of Zampi by solving puzzles and destroying the magical pillars blocking the water. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/004103546933b89483bde20e1c1d11db.avif?t=1772541551\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of your journey, you meet other characters and slowly uncover what exactly happened that led to the downfall of Zampi. The animated cutscenes in the game add to the storyline and keep you wanting for more. Puzzles become more interesting and challenging to solve with different configurations as you proceed further in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/bdcf22b3914d4c3b59ebfd7b6b3ebe83.poster.avif?t=1772541551\" width=598 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/bdcf22b3914d4c3b59ebfd7b6b3ebe83.webm?t=1772541551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/bdcf22b3914d4c3b59ebfd7b6b3ebe83.mp4?t=1772541551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/a0adcbad9e26baf265bb1889f11d2edf.avif?t=1772541551\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game based in the southern part of Ancient India.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 simple and unique logical puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engrossing mystery surrounding the past, unveils the truth as you press forward on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly stylized, beautiful hand drawn artwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial Controller Support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/006b6d2116806c78cf3759f3a01b7ba6.avif?t=1772541551\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Inspired by the board game Mancala / Ali Guli Mane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Supported in 20+ languages - English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, Chinese (Simplified &amp; Traditional), Japanese, Korean, Portuguese EU, Polish, Turkish, Portuguese BR, Hindi, Kannada, Telugu, Tamil, Arabic, Catalan, Hebrew</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Voice over in English and Kannada (the local language in Bangalore, India)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Official Showcase as part of Unite India 2018 event</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Official Selection: Indie Megabooth GDC Showcase 2020</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"aed279f3950a02693127b5f0f1494c0886f9847b.jpg","localized_name":"Taking Root","name":"Taking Root","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1197030/aed279f3950a02693127b5f0f1494c0886f9847b.jpg"},{"icon":"782f37f4ad3602e3ce1d63360e2e5749bd4ac2cc.jpg","localized_name":"Fresh Off the Forge","name":"Fresh Off the Forge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1197030/782f37f4ad3602e3ce1d63360e2e5749bd4ac2cc.jpg"},{"icon":"b9a3606f7ed36095e3cf49853b502ac427ddf73d.jpg","localized_name":"A Show of Might","name":"A Show of Might","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1197030/b9a3606f7ed36095e3cf49853b502ac427ddf73d.jpg"},{"icon":"ee475abb4a6ab922ef023ae29eb89c5c395dd2d8.jpg","localized_name":"A Hard Bargain","name":"A Hard Bargain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1197030/ee475abb4a6ab922ef023ae29eb89c5c395dd2d8.jpg"},{"icon":"30f4a397be6406e5ff6793e57e246b6ec4ba6ca5.jpg","localized_name":"Boil and Bubble","name":"Boil and Bubble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams