tore_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/004103546933b89483bde20e1c1d11db.avif?t=1772541551\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of your journey, you meet other characters and slowly uncover what exactly happened that led to the downfall of Zampi. The animated cutscenes in the game add to the storyline and keep you wanting for more. Puzzles become more interesting and challenging to solve with different configurations as you proceed further in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/bdcf22b3914d4c3b59ebfd7b6b3ebe83.poster.avif?t=1772541551\" width=598 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/bdcf22b3914d4c3b59ebfd7b6b3ebe83.webm?t=1772541551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/bdcf22b3914d4c3b59ebfd7b6b3ebe83.mp4?t=1772541551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/extras/a0adcbad9e26baf265bb1889f11d2edf.avif?t=1772541551\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game based in the southern part of Ancient India.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 simple and unique logical puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engrossing mystery surrounding the past, unveils the truth as you press forward on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly stylized, beautiful hand drawn artwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial Controller Support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_para