],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"true"},"igrs":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Kekerasan","rating":"15","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"15","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"4 Mar, 2020"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cAn interesting twist on your typical puzzle game which leads to a fun experience.\u201d<br>3.5/5 \u2013 Geeky Hobbies<br><br>\u201cThey say video games can\u2019t teach you anything. They say it\u2019s not an art form and it can\u2019t offer you a single drop of culture. Whoever said that really needs to give Mystic Pillars a shot. Not only did I feel smart tackling its math-based puzzles like a smug scholar, but also made me want to dive into Indian culture.\u201d<br>7/10 \u2013 waytoomanygames<br><br>\u201cMystic Pillars is a great puzzle game that not only looks pretty but the art design and lore of the game is pretty unique. The gameplay is solid as well because the puzzles will keep you busy for a good time.\u201d<br>Preview \u2013 Games Hedge<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/b6ee5bd56e45025f581f6743e70f27ed5221a9e0/ss_b6ee5bd56e45025f581f6743e70f27ed5221a9e0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772541551","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/b6ee5bd56e45025f581f6743e70f27ed5221a9e0/ss_b6ee5bd56e45025f581f6743e70f27ed5221a9e0.600x338.jpg?t=1772541551"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/857673ffdaf6540b685d9304a9ba5d12d19b9c4d/ss_857673ffdaf6540b685d9304a9ba5d12d19b9c4d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772541551","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1197030/857673ffdaf6540b685d9304a9ba5d12d19b9c4d/ss_8576